                        <h5>About us</h5>
                        <h2>Welcome to E-DITI!</h2>
                        <p> We are a digital education platform designed to enhance the learning experience for students and simplify the management of teaching activities for educators. 
                            Our mission is to provide innovative tools that support the learning process, ensuring every student can learn in a way that suits their needs. We envision being a leading educational platform that connects teachers and students interactively and effectively. 
