    <section class="feature_part" id="feature">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12">
                    <div class="single_feature_text">
                        <h2>Awesome Feature</h2>
                        <p>Digital education platform that facilitates the management of teaching and learning activities</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-6 col-xl-3">
                    <div class="single_feature">
                        <div class="single_feature_part">
                            <span class="single_feature_icon"><i class="ti-layers"></i></span>
                            <h4>Presence</h4>
                            <p>The E-DITI attendance feature allows teachers to easily and quickly record student attendance online. 
                                Teachers can monitor each student's presence in real-time, and attendance reports can be downloaded for administrative purposes.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-6 col-xl-3">
                    <div class="single_feature">
                        <div class="single_feature_part">
                            <span class="single_feature_icon"><i class="ti-new-window"></i></span>
                            <h4>Material</h4>
                            <p>The E-DITI material feature provides easy access to various learning resources needed by students. 
                                Teachers can upload documents, videos, and presentations that students can access anytime to support their learning process.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-6 col-xl-3">
                    <div class="single_feature">
                        <div class="single_feature_part">
                            <span class="single_service_icon style_icon"><i class="ti-light-bulb"></i></span>
                            <h4>Assignment</h4>
                            <p>The E-DITI assignment feature simplifies the process for teachers to assign and manage tasks for students. 
                                Teachers can set deadlines and receive task submissions online, while students can easily upload their work.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-6 col-xl-3">
                    <div class="single_feature">
                        <div class="single_feature_part">
                            <span class="single_service_icon style_icon"><i class="ti-light-bulb"></i></span>
                            <h4>Announcements</h4>
                            <p>The E-DITI announcement feature allows teachers to quickly send important information to students. 
                                Teachers can post announcements to keep students updated with the latest information.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>    
